      <mxCell id="cell_10" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-family:Segoe UI, sans-serif; padding:10px 12px; text-align:left; box-sizing:border-box; width:100%; height:100%;&quot;&gt;
      &lt;div style=&quot;font-size:12px; font-weight:800; color:#0f172a; line-height:1.3; word-break:break-word;&quot;&gt;TRÍCH XUẤT MINH CHỨNG KIỂM THỬ THỰC TẾ (OFFICIAL TEST EXECUTION LOG):&lt;/div&gt;
      &lt;div style=&quot;font-size:10px; color:#475569; margin-top:2px; line-height:1.35; font-weight:500; word-break:break-word;&quot;&gt;Thực thi lệnh flutter test trên máy trạm trước khi đóng gói phiên bản bảo vệ&lt;/div&gt;
      &lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:6px; padding-top:6px; border-top:1px dashed #64748b; font-size:10px; color:#1e293b; line-height:1.45; word-break:break-word;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:3px;&quot;&gt;• 00:01 +0: AppPrimaryButton renders label and triggers onPressed ................................... [PASS]&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:3px;&quot;&gt;• 00:01 +1: TicketCard does not overflow with long student name and event location .................... [PASS]&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:3px;&quot;&gt;• 00:01 +6: AuthService.signInWithEmailPassword validates FPT email domains ........................... [PASS]&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:3px;&quot;&gt;• 00:01 +11: ExploreViewModel filteredClubs supports Vietnamese accent-free search .................... [PASS]&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:3px;&quot;&gt;• 00:01 +12: DigitalTicketScreen locks feedback button when ticket is not checked in (BR-005) .......... [PASS]&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:3px;&quot;&gt;• 00:01 +13: DigitalTicketScreen unlocks feedback button when ticket is checked in (BR-005) ........ [PASS]&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:3px;&quot;&gt;• 00:01 +15: MyTicketsViewModel reacts to check-in and transitions ticket to attended tab ............. [PASS]&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:3px;&quot;&gt;• 00:01 +17: EventModel.isPast accurately tracks expiration based on current runtime date ............. [PASS]&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:3px;&quot;&gt;• 00:01 +18: FirestoreService blocks registration for past events (BR-004) ............................ [PASS]&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:3px;&quot;&gt;• 00:01 +19: GeminiAiService initializes with 10 official API keys and supports round-robin rotation .. [PASS]&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:3px;&quot;&gt;• 00:01 +20: GeminiAiService automatically rotates key on HTTP 429 quota error ....................... [PASS]&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:3px;&quot;&gt;• 00:01 +21: All tests passed! (21/21 Passed in 1.8s) ------------------------------------------- [100% OK]&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
